window.EN={"1":"Lifis, I think you know this, but don't lay a hand on that sister.","2":"Y-yeah... I got it...","3":"Hey, Safy, please. I'll grant any wish you have.","4":"So do what I say.","5":"I'm sorry. I have an important mission entrusted to me by Lady Linoan.","6":"Or would you fight for Tahra, Lifis?","7":"You're telling me to fight the imperial army?","8":"That's crazy. There's no way we'd win.","9":"I know I'm asking the impossible.","10":"But to offer up innocent children as sacrifices...","11":"as human beings, that is not something that can be forgiven.","12":"We are prepared to be wiped out. Even so, we decided to resist.","13":"...The citizens of Tahra do not fight only for themselves.","14":"Before long, this whole world will be covered in darkness.","15":"If we don't rise up now, the world will be ruled by the dark god Loptous.","16":"Please, Lifis, lend me your strength!","17":"For Tahra... no, for our future, I want you to fight with us!","18":"Hmm...","19":"If I said OK, would you grant my wish?","20":"Yes, if it's something I can do...","21":"All right. I'll persuade my men and go to Tahra. In return, keep your promise.","22":"Yes!","23":"The sun has set. I can't see anything...","24":"If we had a torch, we could see our surroundings for a little while...","25":"Would fighting without one be hard after all?","26":"The range of vision is quite different, after all.","27":"However, there are probably torches on this island too. There is no need to worry.","28":"Then let's go.","29":"We can't waste time in a place like this!","30":"Boss, are we really going to Tahra?","31":"We don't want to. Fighting the Empire? No thanks. We don't want to die yet.","32":"I know.","33":"It's just a pretext to make that girl mine.","34":"Who'd go to a place like Tahra?","35":"Damn that Shiva.","36":"A mere mercenary, showing weird sympathy!","37":"Boss, it's noisy over to the west.","38":"Looks like some rats have gotten in.","39":"What!? Damn it, they've got some nerve!","40":"All right, everyone move out. Catch them quick and turn them into fish food!","41":"Eyvel, there are quite a lot of pirates. Can we win?","42":"We'll be fine. As long as we don't overreach, there is nothing to fear.","43":"Eyvel, do you know this man Lifis?","44":"Yes... Lifis is just a petty crook. He isn't even worth killing.","45":"Lord Leif, if you capture Lifis, please don't let him go.","46":"Let's take him back to the village of Ith and make him atone to the villagers.","47":"Heh. Foolish people...","48":"Impossible... To the likes of them...","49":"Soft-hearted people... But I owe you one now...","50":"W-wait! I was wrong! Don't kill me!","51":"Ugh... It hurts, Safy...","52":"Looks like I'll just have to start over again. So long, fools.","53":"The pirates seem to have fled, but is the sister safe?","54":"I have brought her here.","55":"Thank you very much. Thanks to you... Huh!? ...It can't be...","56":"Sister, is there something on my face?","57":"Lord Leif, have you forgotten?","58":"It's me, Safy of Tahra!!","59":"Safy... The girl who was at the convent in Tahra... Come to think of it, her name was Safy...","60":"I only met you two or three times, Prince,","61":"so it's no wonder you don't remember.","62":"But I remember clearly.","63":"When you fled from Tahra,","64":"I was the one who comforted Lady Linoan as she broke down in tears...","65":"Come to think of it, you were Linoan's friend. A priest's daughter, I believe...","66":"Friend? Oh, no...","67":"Lady Linoan is the daughter of the ducal house of Tahra.","68":"I am one who serves Lady Linoan.","69":"So why are you in a place like this? Is Linoan well?","70":"Prince, do you not know what has happened in Tahra?","71":"After the Duke passed away, Tahra was governed by imperial officials,","72":"but on top of continued terrible misrule, this year the child hunts began.","73":"Child hunts...","74":"The townspeople could not bear this, and with Lady Linoan as their leader, they rose in revolt.","75":"They hired many mercenaries, and sent large bribes to high imperial officials as well,","76":"striving to win back self-rule.","77":"But King Bloom would not allow it, and the city was surrounded by a great imperial army.","78":"The frightened mercenaries ran away, and now a handful of volunteers and citizens are fighting a hopeless battle.","79":"By Lady Linoan's order, seeking warriors who will fight for Tahra,","80":"I have been visiting places all over Thracia.","81":"So that's what's been happening in Tahra...","82":"The Duke of Tahra sheltered me for five whole years, and was executed by the Empire for that crime.","83":"I will never forget my debt to the Duke.","84":"I'm going to Tahra.","85":"I will save Tahra, I swear it.","86":"Safy, let's go back together.","87":"Yes, Lord Leif! Thank you so much!!","88":"Hey, hey, what's going to happen to me?","89":"You'll be handed over to the villagers. They'll decide your punishment.","90":"W-wait! If you do that, I'll be killed!","91":"Come on, help me. Safy, say something for me too.","92":"Didn't we promise to go to Tahra together?","93":"Lord Leif, this man is not such a bad person.","94":"Piracy is wrong, but he has already repented. Please spare him.","95":"If Safy says that much... All right. We'll watch him for a while.","96":"Heh. I'm saved. Maybe I'll find a chance and slip away...","97":"Wait. If this guy really is the prince, selling him to the Empire is an option too...","98":"Well, whatever, I'll think it over slowly. Either way, it comes after I've made Safy mine..."};
